      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    starting_assets = 515.0\n    ending_assets = 602.5\n    high_water_mark = 540.0\n    hurdle_rate = 0.05\n    management_fee_rate = 0.02\n    performance_fee_rate = 0.20\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    hurdle_value = starting_assets * (1 + hurdle_rate)\n    performance_fee_threshold = max(high_water_mark, hurdle_value)\n    management_fee = ending_assets * management_fee_rate\n    performance_fee = max(0.0, ending_assets - performance_fee_threshold) * performance_fee_rate\n    net_ending_assets = ending_assets - management_fee - performance_fee\n    answer = (net_ending_assets / starting_assets - 1) * 100\n\n    # return answer\n    return round(answer, 3)\n```",
